<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova 28-day Tbills up, 91-day flat,182-day down.</title>
<headline>Moldova 28-day Tbills up, 91-day flat,182-day down.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised yield on Moldovan 28-day Treasury bills rose to 30.69 percent on Tuesday from 27.96 percent at the previous auction on March 4, a National Bank official told Reuters.</p>
<p>The yield on 91-day T-bills remained steady at 30.19 percent, while yields on 182-day T-bills fell to 27.09 percent from 30.23 percent.</p>
<p>Full details of the 28-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>				    March 11	   March 4</p>
<p> Issue volume		    2.00 million lei     2.00 million lei</p>
<p> Denominations		   1,000 lei	  1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		  1.33 million	   2.19 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		     1.2 million	    2.00 million</p>
<p> Yield			     30.69 pct	  27.96 pct</p>
<p> Price			     97.7 pct	   97.9 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		   97.7-98.7 pct    97.9-98.7 pct</p>
<p> Maturity			  Apr 10, 1997     Apr 3, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the three-month T-bill auction:</p>
<p>				    March 11	   March 4</p>
<p> Issue volume		    25.00 million	  28.00 million</p>
<p> Denominations		   1,000 lei	  1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		  17.53 million	  27.66 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		     16.4 million	   26.1 million</p>
<p> Yield			     30.19 pct	  30.19 pct</p>
<p> Price			     93.0 pct	   93.0 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		   93.0-94.0 pct    93.0-94.5 pct</p>
<p> Maturity			  June 12, 1997     June 5, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the 182-day paper auction:</p>
<p>				    March 11	   March 4</p>
<p> Issue volume		    3.00 million lei     7.00 million lei</p>
<p> Denominations		   1,000 lei	  1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		  1.02 million	   2.48 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		     1.0 million	    1.6 million</p>
<p> Yield			     27.09 pct	  30.23 pct</p>
<p> Price			     88.1 pct	   86.9 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		   88.1 pct	   86.9-91.0 pct</p>
<p>Maturity			  Sept 11, 1997    Sept 4, 1997</p>
